            "line": 356,
            "text": "theorem powerE_coefficient (F : Profile) (XR X : ℝ) (hXR : 0 < XR) (hX : 0 < X) :\n    powerE F XR X = (powerConstant F.data * XR ^ (1 / 2 + F.data.h)) * X ^ (-(1 / 2 + F.data.h))"
